<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov rice exports soar 713.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov rice exports soar 713.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's rice exports reached 250,000 tonnes in the first 11 months of this year, soaring by 713.2 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Rice exports in November alone were 10,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China's rice imports slumped 58.4 percent to 660,000 tonnes in the first 11 months, compared with the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports in November alone were 120,000 tonnes.</p>
</text>
